            <title>[LU-20440] Lintian marks iokit-config and lsvcgss.service as executable-not-elf-or-script</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20440</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently working on a custom package for Lustre on Ubuntu Noble, and running Lintian on the generated packages shows a couple of warnings:&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-none&quot;&gt;
